ways (i) automatic via API or (ii) manual via our Portal. We can support both single transaction or batch file."},{name:"The pay-out request is processed immediately after you create."}]}],listQa1:[{id:2,question:"Which fee I need to pay?",answers:[{name:"We just collect the Merchant discount rate (MDR), no Set-up fee, Monthly fee, Hidden fee. The MDR for a merchant depends on each payment methods and the estimated volume through 9Pay."},{name:"The higher volume you have, the better fee we could provide."}]},{id:4,question:"Which currency of the settlement?",answers:[{name:"You can choose the currency as USD, EUR, GBP, SGD... The rate of VND -> other currency follows the actual rate of the bank on the settlement day."}]},{id:6,question:"How can I register?",answers:[{name:"Please let us know your information. Our Biz team shall contact you and discuss which payment methods may suit your demand."},{name:"Our flow is below:"},{name:"- Confirm commercial terms <br/>- Sign Agreement and do Due diligence process <br/>- Integrate APIs and go live"}]},{id:44,question:"Which currency can you pay-out?",answers:[{name:"We can pay-out in VND only."}]}]},{id:2,listQa:[{id:1,question:"How can I contact 9Pay when I have enquiries?",answers:[{name:"Our support team works from 8:00 - 22:00 VNT everyday, even in weekend or holiday. Hence you can contact us anytime via email or Operation group."}]},{id:3,question:"Which languages do you support?",answers:[{name:"We can support English fluently."}]}],listQa1:[{id:2,question:"How long does it take to process a refund?",answers:[{name:"- For Pay-Out service: After the status update transaction fails, the transaction will be refunded immediately."},{name:"- For Pay-In service: 9Pay will process the refund within 1 to 3 working days after receiving your request."}]}]},{id:3,listQa:[{id:1,question:"Do you have API documents to integrate into the system?",answers:[{name:"Yes, we do have API documents for all of our service so you can integrate easily into your system."}]},{id:3,question:"How can I receive support during my integration?",answers:[{name:"We can create an Integration Group in Skype/WhatsApp/ Telegram to support any technical questions from your side."}]},{id:5,question:"How long does the integration normally take?",answers:[{name:"It mostly depends on your resources. Normally our merchants need around 1 week to finish the integration, then do the UAT and go live after that."}]},{id:7,question:"Could you give an estimate of the highest QPS/TPS that we have hit?",answers:[{name:"We can record and settle 60 - 100 query per second. For requests, we can receive as much as possible when you submit and handle by queues."}]}],listQa1:[{id:2,question:"When will the IPN be sent to us?",answers:[{name:"We send automatically and immediately when getting final status from bank notification."}]},{id:4,question:"How many time to settle a disbursement request?",answers:[{name:"98% of requests are processed within 1 minute, and successful rate is 99.9%."}]},{id:6,question:"How many time to settle a collection request?",answers:[{name:"97% of requests are processed within 10 minutes, and successful rate is 80%. The remaining 20% is due to payment is not finished by clients."}]}]},{id:4,listQa:[{id:1,question:"How can we prefund for pay-out service?",answers:[{name:"You can make wire transfer to our USD bank account. We will receive within 1 working day."}]},{id:3,question:"Which FX spread we have from 9Pay for pay-out service?",answers:[{name:"We can provide better FX rate than the public rate of the bank, our rate is very closed to the actual live rate."}]}],listQa1:[{id:2,question:"Do we need to pay tax when collecting the money from Vietnam?",answers:[{name:"There is a tax called Foreign contractor tax (FCT) applied to all foreign entities when you have income from Vietnam. We can check your entity and your business nature to define the tax amount you need to pay."}]},{id:4,question:"How can I pay FCT?",answers:[{name:"9Pay supports you to deduct the tax from the total payment and pay it on behalf to the Tax Authorities, then provide you the Proof of paying tax."}]}]}],p=[{id:1,question:"What is 9Remit?",answers:[{name:"9Remit is an cross-border money transfer services under the 9Pay ecosystem. It provides secure, reliable, and fast settlement solutions for outbound transactions from Vietnam."}]},{id:2,question:"What currencies does 9Remit support for sending and receiving?",answers:[{name:"9Remit accepts Vietnamese Dong (VND) as the input currency in Vietnam and delivers funds to recipients abroad in US Dollars (USD) or the local currency of the destination country."}]},{id:3,question:"How long does it take for recipients to receive funds via 9Remit?",answers:[{name:"9Remit processes transaction within the same day."}]},{id:4,question:"What are 9Remit's limits on transfer amounts, operating hours, and transaction frequency?",answers:[{name:"9Remit imposes no limits on the transfer amount or number of transactions."}]},{id:5,question:"How does 9Remit determine exchange rates for transfers?",answers:[{name:"9Remit provides customers with highly competitive exchange rates based on market benchmarks."}]}]}}]);